  "action": "Vultr exploratory sensitivity study (NON-CANONICAL). 12 configs on Vultr VPS 45.32.122.6 (KE 4d7e412, DR 5884ba3), 694.9s compute, ~.002. Key finding: GDP->emissions saturation at tick 4 caps intervention differentiation to ticks 1-3 of 20; both arms identical thereafter (CO2 ~2e8, eventChance pinned 0.5). Admission quantization: multipliers bounded {1.0,1.2,1.3,1.5}; inert below 1.5. CO2 leverage raises divergence frequency (3/8->7/8) but direction sign-unstable. Discharge/horizon infeasible (superlinear DR cost). Isolation held as designed. 3 candidate experiments proposed, not frozen. No manuscript/QMS/PhaseF changes."
